  notes: >-
    Underlying dataset images are sourced from iNaturalist Australia
    (CC-BY-NC) and the Atlas of Living Australia (mixed licences,
    typically CC-BY). Please respect the licence of each source
    image. The AUSLAN vocabulary is provisional and pending
    participatory validation with the Deaf community.
